    "The first native attempt really starved to death; it is retained, followed by the same character/save and normal recovery of its one dropped seed. No state/HP/coordinate/time or inventory edits.",
    "Map-only information and label changes do not claim a new biome, added houses, new terrain art or revised resource density. Existing art was sufficient for this scope.",
    "The label audit verifies route-point labels against region titles; the existing city/industrial region-title boxes retain a small corner intersection outside the added route labels.",
    "The detailed seven-stop/mobile/marker pass used the label-only build. Final build repeated the east map and actual front-stop gameplay. Existing global mobile HUD crowding remains.",
    "Deep gas station/city/factory combat and a complete return to camp have not been natively completed. Real node/loot/industrial recipe relationships are separately tested; wood/stone/blueprints/ammo are still required.",
    "Final page retained all five slow records: draw max77.5ms and RAF max138ms, including early/loading and movement/interaction. Older label-only page has11 retained records; initial E_6 page full diagnostics were not exported. No combined comparison or frame-rate improvement claim.",
    "347.6 game units in the recovery session is segmented movement, not continuous60s/P95/GPU/physical-presentation/long-memory acceptance. Single JS heap is not browser process memory.",
    "Passive server observer adds bounded logging and copying overhead. Native screenshots precede the final checkpoint and are not exact final satiety snapshots."
